WEBVTT

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:16.490
How are things going?

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:20.070
Doctor Stanley.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.710
The fusion experiment as well
as computerized control tests

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:26.830
are going exceedingly well.

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:30.710
Make sure to make them tough.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.530
Looks like this is going
to be an extravagant stage.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:14.860
According to Gina's information,

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:18.070
we need to cross a giant mountain
before reaching El Dorado.

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:19.280
Need a gas stand?

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.410
I'm doing fine.

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:23.820
You're the one with exhaustion
written all over your face.

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:26.080
Huh? Really?

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:27.900
What's going on with that?

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:33.790
She's been pissed off since this morning.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:35.660
Don't lean out too far.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.550
Sword has been ignoring me!

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.800
He'll grow to dislike 
you if you're too pushy.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.520
But Sword was the one who ate
my chocolate without even asking!

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:47.890
Is that so?

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:54.060
Yeah! It was valuable chocolate
that I got from Ferre Salé Dessimo!

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:57.280
I was saving it so that
we could all eat it together!

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:00.610
Oh, my. That really is a serious crime!

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:03.030
Jeez! Even you, Gina.

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:09.540
Gina, over there.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:10.830
The ocean?!

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:14.040
Wow!

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:29.730
This place is different 
from what I expected...

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:36.900
There's no way an area on the
western side would be doing great.

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:41.750
It will probably get bleaker from here.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:48.040
This will probably be our last
real rest stop before El Dorado.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:50.200
We'll spend the night
and head out in the morning?

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:51.050
That sounds good.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:52.290
Right?

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:57.630
Hey, now. Are you still mad?

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.510
You ate my chocolate without asking.

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:04.260
I already told you I was sorry about that.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.010
But, you're not!

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.890
Sword, last time you drank my juice, too!

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:13.020
You're snoring is really loud!
And you use too much of the toothpaste!

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:14.940
Okay. Okay. I'm sorry.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.520
Let's go get some groceries.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:17.860
I'm not going.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:19.710
I'm staying here.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:21.820
Sophie.

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:23.860
Leave her alone!

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:29.330
Yeah, just leave me alone!
There are times I want to be alone, too.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:33.690
Man, this babysitting job
is too much to handle.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.290
Job?

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:41.300
Oh, hey!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:50.430
Let's all meet back here
at ten in the morning.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.640
We'll split up until then.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.200
Hey! Don't let him escape!

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.470
Is that kid alone?

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:21.880
Hey, girlie! Come on over here!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.670
It's dangerous alone.

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:26.970
Don't separate from me.

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:28.930
Sorry.

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:32.390
Let's look for a hotel with a bathtub.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:33.850
Yeah!

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:42.270
So cute. It looks delicious...

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:44.190
Yeah, but we can't afford it.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:45.990
You gotta bear with it.

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:47.660
But I wanna eat it...

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.660
Wow! Thank you so much, sir!

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:55.620
See you!

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:03.780
Choco-Choco-Chocolate...

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:12.640
Wait, asshole!

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:15.600
Hey, Pedro! We're gonna kill you!

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:33.340
It's a hundred years too early
for someone like you to off Gordon.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.790
It'll end up the same no
matter how many times you try.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:40.680
Sh-Shit!

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:49.340
M-Monica...

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.060
Wh-Who the hell are you?

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.710
Don't act so recklessly.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:27.670
H-Hey...

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:29.670
Wait a second!

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:32.180
Are you a fighter?!

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.930
You're not from around here, right?

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:36.000
Why did you come to a town like this?

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:42.390
Wait! I'll take you to a restaurant
I know for helping me out!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:43.900
It's fine.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:47.900
You sure? There's a good woman there!

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:50.130
Hm?

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.600
She got some nice curves!

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:56.170
Ouch!

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:00.790
You're so stupid. As usual.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:09.160
She used to be famous as
the prettiest woman in town.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.050
Used to be, anyways.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:19.640
Pedro, at this rate
the gang will really kill you.

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:23.620
I don't care! I'll take
them all down with me...

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:30.780
Just give it up already.

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:35.170
Are you traveling alone?

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:37.780
Well, something like that.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:41.300
Perfect. There's actually
a favor I want to ask...

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.550
Hey, it's Pedro.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:52.380
You're right. The crybaby Pedro!

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:56.600
Those injuries! Could it be you
tried playing revenge again?

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:58.140
Heek! So scary!

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:03.890
If you go against Gordon,
he'll tear you up and feed you to the pigs.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:06.100
And then you'll cry all over again!

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:08.060
Monicaaa!

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:15.900
Oh, that's dangerous.
The injured should just stay asleep.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:18.870
You bastard.

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:20.960
I'm serious!

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.200
I'll kill Gordon!
I'm fine with going down, too.

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:27.210
I'll definitely drag him down into hell!

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.720
Sword'll be fine.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.830
Even if you leave him alone for a night.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:51.650
I acted so terribly.
I'm sure he's sick of me.

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:55.150
I said such childish things, too.

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:59.030
Looks like the exhaustion got to you, too.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:05.480
I wonder if he'll just abandon me...

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:12.010
Sword, abandon you?

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:17.870
Sophie, do you really think he's
just protecting you because it's his job?

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:25.240
Don't worry. I'm sure he'll
meet us with a smile tomorrow.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:31.980
Let me give you a pedicure, too.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.280
Yeah. I want pink!

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:38.280
Pink. I don't have that color.

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:40.200
What?

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:00.510
Sorry about that.

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:03.390
That was embarrassing. Well, sit down.

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.430
The alcohol was good.

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:14.020
It's Monica.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:03.320
I didn't know about the future,

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.450
but I thought things would
be okay with Monica there.

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.870
She was murdered last year.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:20.300
Gordon's gang controls
the turf around here.

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:26.050
All the young girls have to
belong to the gang, otherwise...

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:30.200
I'm going to kill Gordon.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:33.230
Will you help me do it?

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:38.860
I just want you to distract
Gordon's guys! I'll do the rest!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.030
You'll just be wasting your life.

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:44.570
That's fine!

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:46.990
I'd die happy if I can kill him!

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:48.780
Are you serious?

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:52.250
Yeah, I am! I never had
anything to begin with.

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:57.580
Monica was everything!
I don't care about a world without Monica!

00:12:58.910 --> 00:12:59.780
Pedro...

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.260
Is that something
Monica would wish for?

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:10.930
Shut up!

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:14.270
She's no longer in this world!

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:16.980
I'll finish everything!

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:34.910
I thought the same when she died.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:39.350
A world without her had no meaning.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:43.620
A pitch-black future without
her might as well be destroyed.

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:49.850
But, if I die, who will remember her?

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:58.150
I'm the only one.
That's why I decided to live for her, too.

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:01.930
I-I...

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:08.990
I don't need your lecture!
Someone like you!

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:12.330
I didn't... I didn't expect
anything to begin with!

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:14.290
Get out, you coward!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:17.680
Yeah, sorry for bothering you.

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:32.640
...So, it is clear that
Horrors were involved

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:35.390
in the explosion at Signa Slam Tech.

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:42.190
The unknown word "El Dorado"
was the only data we could recover.

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:47.680
With your continued training,
you will become a great Golden Knight...

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.120
Too bad about your little sister.

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:02.500
Some kind of research
facility burned down, right?

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:05.800
It was a laboratory under Signa Slam Tech.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:08.350
It suddenly exploded into a sea of flames!

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:13.470
The kids at the school next door
were in the middle of class...

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:15.920
Poor things. Not a single one survived...

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:26.780
S-Spinach...?

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:31.990
You're going to be the
Golden Knight. Don't be picky!

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.280
But, this bitterness...

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:37.410
You're doing weight training, right?

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:40.690
We have to increase your iron
along with the increase of muscle!

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:44.590
Why don't you think of
that bitterness as nutrition?

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:45.880
You win out that way.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:51.300
You got to enjoy
everything in life, you know!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:52.220
I'm off!

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:53.610
(See you.)

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.570
I will eliminate the Horrors.

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:08.570
And...

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.480
I will protect Lizzy.

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:39.600
Lizzy.

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:45.400
Have I become a proper Golden Knight?

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:57.830
Sword is late.

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:01.160
He probably overslept again. He'll be here.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:03.300
It's all right.

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:06.420
Once he decides on something,
he always goes through with it.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.920
Sh-Shit...!

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:25.390
Someone who goes after my neck
has to be dragged to hell nice and slow.

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:33.740
I-I'll kill you...

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:36.660
What? What?

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:38.980
Revenge for Monica...

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.740
Hey! Hey! He's talkin' revenge!

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.040
I can't believe it.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.920
But, I don't know any Monica.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:49.210
Or maybe she was
some worthless prostitute...

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:51.420
That ain't even worth remembering.

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:57.720
Dammit!

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:00.180
Okay, that's enough.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:05.350
I guess I'll take your eyes, first.

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:19.030
Wh-Who the hell are you?!

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.870
D-Dammit...

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.810
Hey, hey. Don't run away, you guys!

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:49.190
C-Calm down!

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:52.400
What do you want?
I-If it's women you want...

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:05.160
A charm?

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:07.240
That's right. They say it
makes your wish come true.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.960
Seriously?! What wish?

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:12.500
I'm going to leave this town once it snaps.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:12.920
Huh?!

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:16.210
I don't want to spend the rest
of my life in a place like this.

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:18.810
Aren't you the same, Pedro? It's a waste!

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:22.720
Yeah. Let's go!
Let's leave this place together!

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.640
Well, it costs money to leave, too.

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.310
We'll start saving right away.

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:32.510
You're right. If we both
work hard, we can do it easily!

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:36.350
That's right! It'll be easy for us!

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:37.610
Yeah!

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:58.440
Monica!

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:04.930
Monica!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:21.110
Shit! What the hell
was up with those guys?!

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:33.830
U-Um....

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:35.290
Uh...

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:37.710
Yesterday, I...

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:40.710
Sorry. I said something terrible.

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:43.180
Huh? Y-Yeah.

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.530
It's not the same thing, but...

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:52.660
So you were late because you bought that?

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:56.560
W-Well, yeah.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:58.900
Wha!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:00.840
No, wait. This is...

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:03.700
How did this happen
right after you bought it?!

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.700
A lot of stuff happened!

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:06.530
Goodness!

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:07.570
--This is great!
--Huh?

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:11.410
It makes it easy to share. Here!

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:15.160
We got to enjoy everything we do.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:16.790
You're right.

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:22.850
Thank you, Sword!

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:25.720
Yeah, you're welcome.

00:23:29.630 --> 00:23:31.390
What's going on?
